# Paths here are relative to this folder, so they must NOT be prefixed with
# "mcp-servers/" - that would look for mcp-servers/mcp-servers/... and match
# nothing, which is what this file used to do.
#
# The root .gitignore covers these too; this is kept so the rule survives if
# these servers are ever moved or split out on their own.
*/node_modules/
